msgid ""
"Choose people on your network. Each one gets the invitation in BigLace and "
"decides whether to join."
msgstr ""
"Elige personas de tu red. Cada una recibe la invitación en BigLace y decide "
"si se une."

msgid "Search people"
msgstr "Buscar personas"

